{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, approach, grab, process, store and perform specific task if visible, else scan for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInStorage    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
